<title>INDIA: India October gold production 196.2 kg.</title>
<headline>India October gold production 196.2 kg.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 196.2 kg of gold in October, well above the official target of 164.9 kg for the month, a Mines Ministry statement said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said gold production totalled 1,097.2 kg between April and October, up from 989.4 kg produced in the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
